{"seq":1,"slug":"token-categories-and-tiers","title":"令牌类别与层级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/token-architecture/token-categories-and-tiers","wordCount":1530,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"令牌类别与层级\">令牌类别与层级</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>成熟的设计系统令牌（Design Token）不是扁平的一层结构，而是使用多层架构（Multi-tier Architecture）来区分引用层（Reference Tier，存储原始值）、系统层/别名层（System / Alias Tier，语义化映射）和组件层（Component Tier，特定用途）。这种分层设计使得主题切换、品牌重塑、无障碍调整都可以在单一层级完成，而不需要逐个修改组件。Adobe Spectrum 采用三层架构，Material Design 使用 ref/sys/comp 命名，Carbon 也有类似设计。本节详细介绍多层架构的设计原理、命名规范、令牌类别划分，以及各层取值策略。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>别名</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>何时修改</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>引用层 / 全局层</td>\n<td>原始值</td>\n<td><code>color.blue.500 = #3b82f6</code></td>\n<td>极少（品牌调整时）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>系统层 / 别名层 / 语义层</td>\n<td>令牌</td>\n<td><code>color.action.primary = {color.blue.500}</code></td>\n<td>主题切换时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组件层</td>\n<td>特定令牌</td>\n<td><code>button.bg = {color.action.primary}</code></td>\n<td>组件定制时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"引用层\">引用层</h2><p><strong>用途</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>存储原始设计值，如颜色数值、尺寸数值。</li>\n<li>对颜色和尺寸进行纯粹的抽象。</li>\n<li>不携带任何使用场景上下文。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;color&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;blue&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;100&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;#dbeafe&quot; },&#10;      &quot;500&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;#3b82f6&quot; },&#10;      &quot;900&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;#1e3a8a&quot; }&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;gray&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;100&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;#f3f4f6&quot; },&#10;      &quot;500&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;#6b7280&quot; },&#10;      &quot;900&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;#111827&quot; }&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;spacing&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;0&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;0px&quot; },&#10;    &quot;4&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;4px&quot; },&#10;    &quot;8&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;8px&quot; },&#10;    &quot;16&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;16px&quot; },&#10;    &quot;24&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;24px&quot; }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"color\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"blue\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"100\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#dbeafe\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"500\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#3b82f6\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"900\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#1e3a8a\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"gray\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"100\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#f3f4f6\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"500\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#6b7280\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"900\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#111827\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"spacing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"4px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"8\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"8px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"16\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"16px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"24\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"24px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>命名方式</strong>：使用字面量（直接描述值本身），如 <code>color.blue.500</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>使用规则</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>不应直接在产品代码中引用。</li>\n<li>通过系统层进行间接引用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"系统层-别名层\">系统层 / 别名层</h2><p><strong>用途</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>为引用层的原始值提供语义化别名。</li>\n<li>命名描述&quot;用途&quot;而非&quot;值本身&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;color&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;action&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;primary&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;{color.blue.500}&quot; },&#10;      &quot;primary-hover&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;{color.blue.600}&quot; }&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;background&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;default&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;{color.gray.100}&quot; },&#10;      &quot;subtle&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;{color.gray.50}&quot; }&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;text&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;primary&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;{color.gray.900}&quot; },&#10;      &quot;secondary&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;{color.gray.600}&quot; }&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;spacing&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;xs&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;{spacing.4}&quot; },&#10;    &quot;sm&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;{spacing.8}&quot; },&#10;    &quot;md&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;{spacing.16}&quot; },&#10;    &quot;lg&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;{spacing.24}&quot; }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"color\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"primary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{color.blue.500}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"primary-hover\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{color.blue.600}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"background\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{color.gray.100}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"subtle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </