-shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"sm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{spacing.8}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"md\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{spacing.16}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"lg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{spacing.24}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>命名方式</strong>：使用语义化命名（描述用途），如 <code>color.action.primary</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>使用规则</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产品代码主要引用此层。</li>\n<li>主题覆盖在此层进行。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"组件层\">组件层</h2><p><strong>用途</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>针对特定组件的令牌作用域。</li>\n<li>让组件拥有细粒度的控制能力。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;button&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;primary&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;background&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;{color.action.primary}&quot; },&#10;      &quot;background-hover&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;{color.action.primary-hover}&quot; },&#10;      &quot;text&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;{color.text.inverse}&quot; },&#10;      &quot;padding-x&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;{spacing.md}&quot; },&#10;      &quot;padding-y&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;{spacing.sm}&quot; }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"button\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"primary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"background\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{color.action.primary}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"background-hover\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{color.action.primary-hover}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{color.text.inverse}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"padding-x\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{spacing.md}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"padding-y\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{spacing.sm}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>使用规则</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>组件实现直接引用此层。</li>\n<li>支持组件级别的覆盖定制。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要多层架构\">为什么需要多层架构</h2><p><strong>单层架构的问题</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;color.button.bg&quot;: &quot;#3b82f6&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"color.button.bg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#3b82f6\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li>品牌重塑时：需要找到所有组件引用并逐一更新。</li>\n<li>暗色模式时：需要为每个组件重新定义。</li>\n<li>缺乏系统性，维护困难。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>多层架构的解决方案</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"button.bg → action.primary → blue.500 → #3b82f6\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>button.bg → action.primary → blue.500 → #3b82f6</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li>修改引用层的值：只需改一处。</li>\n<li>主题覆盖：在系统层操作即可。</li>\n<li>组件灵活性：在组件层覆盖。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[引用层] --&gt; B[blue.500: #3b82f6]&#10;    C[系统层] --&gt; D[action.primary: blue.500]&#10;    E[组件层] --&gt; F[button.bg: action.primary]&#10;    G[CSS 输出] --&gt; H[--button-bg: #3b82f6]&#10;    A --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; G\">graph LR\n    A[引用层] --&gt; B[blue.500: #3b82f6]\n    C[系统层] --&gt; D[action.primary: blue.500]\n    E[组件层] --&gt; F[button.bg: action.primary]\n    G[CSS 输出] --&gt; H[--button-bg: #3b82f6]\n    A --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; G</pre><h2 id=\"主题切换\">主题切换</h2><p><strong>亮色主题的系统层</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;color.background.default&quot;: &quot;{color.gray.50}&quot;,&#10;  &quot;color.text.primary&quot;: &quot;{color.gray.900}&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"color.background.default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{color.gray.50}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"color.text.primary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{color.gray.900}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>暗色主题的系统层</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;color.background.default&quot;: &quot;{color.gray.900}&quot;,&#10;  &quot;color.text.primary&quot;: &quot;{color.gray.50}&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"color.background.default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{color.gray.900}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"color.text.primary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{color.gray.50}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>组件层保持不变</strong>——按钮背景仍然引用 <code>action.primary</code>，无需任何修改。</p>\n<p><strong>实施方式</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>通过 CSS 变量作用域配合 <code>[data-theme=dark]</code> 属性切换。</li>\n<li>或使用 <code>prefers-color-scheme</code> 媒体查询。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"品牌重塑\">品牌重塑</h2><p><strong>只需修改引用层</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;color.brand.primary&quot;: &quot;{color.blue.500}&quot;,&#10;  &quot;color.brand.primary&quot;: &quot;{color.green.500}&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"color.brand.primary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{color.blue.500}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"color.brand.primary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{color.green.500}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li>仅修改一行代码。</li>\n<li>自动向下传播到所有消费者。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"命名规范\">命名规范</h2><p><strong>引用层</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>描述值本身：<code>color.blue.500</code>、<code>spacing.16</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>系统层</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>描述用途：<code>color.action.primary</code>、<code>spacing.md</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>组件层</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>描述组件具体属性：<code>button.primary.background</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>层级结构</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>类别.类型.修饰符.状态</code></li>\n<li>例如：<code>color.text.primary.disabled</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>最佳实践</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>不要使用 &quot;color1&quot;、&quot;color2&quot; 等无含义命名。</li>\n<li>引用层不要过于具体（保持可复用性）。</li>\n<li>组件层不要过于笼统（保持针对性）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"颜色色阶\">颜色色阶</h2><p><strong>Material 11 级色阶</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>50, 100, 200, ..., 900, A100, A200, A400, A700。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Tailwind 11 级色阶</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>50, 100, 200, ..., 900, 950。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>自定义 5 级色阶</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>最浅、浅、基准、深、最深。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>选择建议</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>11 级：需要细粒度控制时使用。</li>\n<li>5 级：追求简洁时使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>色阶生成方法</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>手动选取。</li>\n<li>算法生成（基于 HSL 明度步进）。</li>\n<li>工具辅助（Tailwind 调色板生成器、Adobe Leonardo 等）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"间距色阶\">间距色阶</h2><p><strong>4 像素 / 8 像素网格</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>spacing.4 = 4px</code>、<code>spacing.8 = 8px</code>、<code>spacing.16 = 16px</code>。</li>\n<li>2 的幂次（4、8、16、24、32、48、64）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>T 恤尺码命名</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>xs = 4</code>、<code>sm = 8</code>、<code>md = 16</code>、<code>lg = 24</code>、<code>xl = 32</code>、<code>2xl = 48</code>、<code>3xl = 64</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>小数刻度</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>0.25 / 0.5 / 1 / 2 / 4 / 8 rem。</li>\n<li>Tailwind 风格。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>引用层与系统层对应</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>引用层：<code>spacing.16</code>（字面量）。</li>\n<li>系统层：<code>spacing.md</code>（语义化）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"排版色阶\">排版色阶</h2><p><strong>字号比例系数</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>1.125（大二度音程）。</li>\n<li>1.25（大三度音程）。</li>\n<li>1.333（纯四度）。</li>\n<li>1.5（纯五度）。</li>\n<li>1.618（黄金比例）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>选择比例 + 基准字号</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>基准 16px + 比例 1.25 → 16, 20, 25, 31, 39, 49, 61, 76。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>排版令牌示例</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;typography&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;heading&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;lg&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;fontSize&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;32px&quot; },&#10;        &quot;lineHeight&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;1.2&quot; },&#10;        &quot;fontWeight&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;600&quot; }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"typography\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"heading\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"lg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"fontSize\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"32px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"lineHeight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"fontWeight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"600\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>复合令牌</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一个排版令牌包含多个子属性（字号、行高、字重等）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"多品牌令牌命名\">多品牌令牌命名</h2><p><strong>品牌 1</strong>：<code>color.brand.primary = blue.500</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>品牌 2</strong>：<code>color.brand.primary = green.500</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>组件引用</strong>：<code>button.bg = color.brand.primary</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>多品牌策略</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>相同的组件代码。</li>\n<li>不同的系统层取值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"令牌与硬编码对比\">令牌与硬编码对比</h2><p><strong>反模式</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".button {&#10;  background: #3b82f6;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  background</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">#3b82f6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>正确模式</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".button {&#10;  background: var(--color-action-primary);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  background</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--color-action-primary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>使用令牌的优势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>支持主题切换。</li>\n<li>支持品牌重塑。</li>\n<li>支持跨平台分发。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实施示例\">实施示例</h2><p><strong>Style Dictionary 配置</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// config.js&#10;module.exports = {&#10;  source: [&#39;tokens/**/*.json&#39;],&#10;  platforms: {&#10;    css: {&#10;      transformGroup: &#39;css&#39;,&#10;      buildPath: &#39;build/css/&#39;,&#10;      files: [&#10;        {&#10;          destination: &#39;variables.css&#39;,&#10;          format: &#39;css/variables&#39;,&#10;        },&#10;      ],&#10;    },&#10;    iOS: {&#10;      transformGroup: &#39;ios&#39;,&#10;      buildPath: &#39;build/ios/&#39;,&#10;      files: [&#10;        {&#10;          destination: &#39;tokens.swift&#39;,&#10;          format: &#39;ios-swift/class.swift&#39;,&#10;        },&#10;      ],&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// config.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module.exports = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  source: ['tokens/**/*.json'],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  platforms: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    css: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      transformGroup: 'css',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      buildPath: 'build/css/',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      files: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          destination: 'variables.css',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          format: 'css/variables',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    iOS: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      transformGroup: 'ios',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      buildPath: 'build/ios/',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      files: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          destination: 'tokens.swift',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          format: 'ios-swift/class.swift',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>输出结果</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CSS：<code>--color-action-primary: #3b82f6;</code>。</li>\n<li>iOS：<code>static let colorActionPrimary = UIColor(hex: &quot;#3b82f6&quot;)</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"常见反模式\">常见反模式</h2><p><strong>1. 缺少引用层</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>直接将原始值写入系统层：<code>action.primary = &quot;#3b82f6&quot;</code>。</li>\n<li>无法复用抽象。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 缺少系统层</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>组件直接引用原始值。</li>\n<li>主题切换困难。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 层级混淆</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>同一令牌名称出现在不同层级。</li>\n<li>造成引用混乱。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 过度细化</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>button.primary.solid.large.hover.bg</code>。</li>\n<li>维度过多，难以管理。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 单位不一致</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>spacing.md = 16</code>、<code>spacing.lg = &quot;24px&quot;</code>。</li>\n<li>混用有单位和无单位值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>成熟的设计系统令牌采用多层架构——引用层/全局层（原始值如 <code>color.blue.500 = #3b82f6</code>，字面量命名，极少变更）加系统层/别名层/语义层（描述用途如 <code>color.action.primary = {color.blue.500}</code>，主题覆盖在此层进行）加组件层（组件特定如 <code>button.bg = {color.action.primary}</code>）。多层架构让主题切换（亮色/暗色只改系统层，组件不变）、品牌重塑（只改引用层一行）和组件灵活定制都变得简单。命名规范方面，引用层用字面量、系统层用语义化、组件层用具体属性名，层级结构为&quot;类别.类型.修饰符.状态&quot;。颜色色阶有 Material/Tailwind 11 级和自定义 5 级两种选择，可通过算法或工具生成。间距色阶基于 4/8 像素网格和 2 的幂次，配合 T 恤尺码命名。排版色阶基于音乐比例 1.125-1.618 加基准字号，支持复合令牌。多品牌方案使用相同组件、不同系统层取值。通过 Style Dictionary 可输出 CSS 变量和 iOS Swift 常量。应避免的反模式包括：缺少引用层、缺少系统层、层级混淆、过度细化和单位不一致。多层令牌架构是设计系统工程化的核心抽象——让设计决策变得可维护、可扩展且跨平台一致。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"令牌类别与层级","id":"令牌类别与层级"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"引用层","id":"引用层"},{"level":2,"text":"系统层 / 别名层","id":"系统层-别名层"},{"level":2,"text":"组件层","id":"组件层"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要多层架构","id":"为什么需要多层架构"},{"level":2,"text":"主题切换","id":"主题切换"},{"level":2,"text":"品牌重塑","id":"品牌重塑"},{"level":2,"text":"命名规范","id":"命名规范"},{"level":2,"text":"颜色色阶","id":"颜色色阶"},{"level":2,"text":"间距色阶","id":"间距色阶"},{"level":2,"text":"排版色阶","id":"排版色阶"},{"level":2,"text":"多品牌令牌命名","id":"多品牌令牌命名"},{"level":2,"text":"令牌与硬编码对比","id":"令牌与硬编码对比"},{"level":2,"text":"实施示例","id":"实施示例"},{"level":2,"text":"常见反模式","id":"常见反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"设计系统治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/design-system-foundations/design-system-governance"},"next":{"title":"颜色令牌与主题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems-tokens/token-architecture/color-tokens-and-theming"}}